key":"fb_color","value":""},{"id":4608,"key":"fb_material","value":""},{"id":4609,"key":"fb_pattern","value":""},{"id":4610,"key":"fb_age_group","value":""},{"id":4611,"key":"fb_gender","value":""},{"id":4612,"key":"fb_product_condition","value":""},{"id":4811,"key":"_wp_old_date","value":"2026-10-20"},{"id":4813,"key":"_last_change_time","value":"1793726088"},{"id":5734,"key":"_wc_gla_sync_status","value":"has-errors"},{"id":5745,"key":"_wc_gla_synced_at","value":"1793036236"},{"id":5746,"key":"_wc_gla_google_ids","value":{"ES":"fr~ES~gla_494"}},{"id":5747,"key":"_wc_gla_sync_hash","value":{"fr|ES":"9c6a67511da6fea502de8c4801e018e3"}},{"id":7138,"key":"rank_math_title","value":"Batterie solaire EcoFlow STREAM Ultra | Sol &amp; Volt"},{"id":7139,"key":"rank_math_description","value":"Batterie solaire EcoFlow STREAM Ultra : 1,92 kWh, micro-onduleur int\u00e9gr\u00e9. Livraison France et Espagne, paiement s\u00e9curis\u00e9."},{"id":7140,"key":"rank_math_focus_keyword","value":"batterie solaire ecoflow stream ultra"},{"id":8397,"key":"_wc_gla_errors","value":["[availabilityDate] Availability date is required if you set the product's availability to backorder or pre-order."]},{"id":9104,"key":"_wc_gla_mc_status","value":"approved"},{"id":9160,"key":"_sv_es_short","value":"Bater\u00eda de almacenamiento EcoFlow STREAM Ultra: 1,92 kWh LiFePO4, microinversor integrado, inyecci\u00f3n de hasta 800 W en toma de 230 V, ampliable hasta 11,52 kWh."},{"id":9161,"key":"_sv_es_hash","value":"1330708a1171929cbd9cf6ab808d519d"},{"id":9162,"key":"_sv_es_review","value":"1"},{"id":9163,"key":"_sv2_title","value":"Bater\u00eda solar EcoFlow STREAM Ultra \u2013 1,92 kWh, microinversor integrado"},{"id":9164,"key":"_sv2_h_title","value":"c7f507b4ecc10147e8a416e98645bfba"},{"id":9165,"key":"_sv2_review","value":"1"},{"id":9166,"key":"_sv2_content","value":"<h2>\u00bfPor qu\u00e9 esta bater\u00eda EcoFlow STREAM Ultra?<\/h2>\n<p>Bater\u00eda de almacenamiento EcoFlow STREAM Ultra con microinversor integrado (2 en 1): 1,92 kWh en LiFePO4, ampliable hasta 11,52 kWh. Almacena la producci\u00f3n de sus paneles durante el d\u00eda y la devuelve por la noche mediante un simple enchufe de 230 V, hasta 800 W.<\/p>\n<h2>Caracter\u00edsticas t\u00e9cnicas<\/h2>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr><td><strong>Marca<\/strong><\/td><td>EcoFlow<\/td><\/tr>\n<tr><td><strong>Modelo<\/strong><\/td><td>STREAM Ultra (800 W)<\/td><\/tr>\n<tr><td><strong>Capacidad<\/strong><\/td><td>1,92 kWh (bater\u00eda LiFePO4), ampliable hasta 11,52 kWh<\/td><\/tr>\n<tr><td><strong>Inyecci\u00f3n en enchufe de 230 V<\/strong><\/td><td>hasta 800 W<\/td><\/tr>\n<tr><td><strong>Salida fuera de red<\/strong><\/td><td>1 200 W<\/td><\/tr>\n<tr><td><strong>Entradas solares<\/strong><\/td><td>4 entradas MPPT, hasta 2 000 W de paneles<\/td><\/tr>\n<tr><td><strong>Carga desde red<\/strong><\/td><td>1 050 W<\/td><\/tr>\n<tr><td><strong>Vida \u00fatil<\/strong><\/td><td>m\u00e1s de 6 000 ciclos<\/td><\/tr>\n<tr><td><strong>Protecci\u00f3n<\/strong><\/td><td>IP65, funcionamiento de -20 a 55 \u00b0C<\/td><\/tr>\n<tr><td><strong>Control<\/strong><\/td><td>aplicaci\u00f3n EcoFlow (Wi-Fi y Bluetooth)<\/td><\/tr>\n<tr><td><strong>Peso neto<\/strong><\/td><td>23,1 kg<\/td><\/tr>\n<tr><td><strong>Dimensiones<\/strong><\/td><td>25,5 x 28,4 x 45,8 cm<\/td><\/tr>\n<tr><td><strong>Contenido<\/strong><\/td><td>bater\u00eda, 8 cables solares, 1 cable de red, fijaciones, manual<\/td><\/tr>\n<tr><td><strong>Referencia<\/strong><\/td><td>SV-ECF0049<\/td><\/tr>\n<\/tbody>\n<\/table>\n[trp_language language=\"fr_FR\"]<p>Le pilotage de l'injection utilise un compteur intelligent EcoFlow ou Shelly, non inclus. En Espagne, un dispositif anti-injection est obligatoire (RD 244\/2019). Pour revendre le surplus, ou si la puissance inject\u00e9e d\u00e9passe 800 VA, il faut une ligne d\u00e9di\u00e9e pos\u00e9e par un installateur autoris\u00e9 et un certificat d'installation \u00e9lectrique (CIE). En France, d\u00e9clarez l'installation au gestionnaire de r\u00e9seau local avant la mise en service.<\/p>[\/trp_language][trp_language language=\"es_ES\"]<p>El control de la inyecci\u00f3n utiliza un contador inteligente EcoFlow o Shelly, no incluido. En Espa\u00f1a, es obligatorio un dispositivo antivertido (RD 244\/2019). Para vender el excedente, o si la potencia inyectada supera 800 VA, se necesita una l\u00ednea dedicada realizada por un instalador autorizado y un certificado de instalaci\u00f3n el\u00e9ctrica (CIE). En Francia, declare la instalaci\u00f3n al gestor de red local antes de la puesta en servicio.<\/p>[\/trp_language]\n<h2>Autonom\u00eda orientativa<\/h2>\n<p>C\u00e1lculo: energ\u00eda \u00d7 90 % \u00fatil \u00f7 potencia del aparato. Valores sin p\u00e9rdidas del inversor.<\/p>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr><td><strong>Aparato<\/strong><\/td><td><strong>Potencia<\/strong><\/td><td><strong>Duraci\u00f3n<\/strong><\/td><\/tr>\n<tr><td>Iluminaci\u00f3n LED, router<\/td><td>10 W<\/td><td>173 h<\/td><\/tr>\n<tr><td>Frigor\u00edfico, televisi\u00f3n<\/td><td>60 W<\/td><td>29 h<\/td><\/tr>\n<tr><td>Ordenador y pantalla, ventilador<\/td><td>100 W<\/td><td>17 h<\/td><\/tr>\n<\/tbody>\n<\/table>\n<h2>\u00bfPara qui\u00e9n est\u00e1 pensada?<\/h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Propietario que ya tiene paneles solares y quiere usar su producci\u00f3n por la noche<\/li>\n<li>Vivienda en la Costa Brava que quiere una bater\u00eda IP65 para instalar al aire libre o en el garaje<\/li>\n<li>Hogar que quiere ampliar la capacidad por etapas, hasta 11,52 kWh<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<div class=\"solandvolt-maillage\">\n<h3>Este producto forma parte de<\/h3>\n<p><a href=\"https:\/\/www.solandvolt.com\/categorie-produit\/lautonomie\/\">La Autonom\u00eda<\/a><\/p>\n<\/div>"},{"id":9167,"key":"_sv2_h_content","value":"e76e4de8bf8c86b845749463fe4a30da"},{"id":9168,"key":"_sv2_seo_title","value":"Bater\u00eda solar EcoFlow STREAM Ultra | Sol & Volt"},{"id":9169,"key":"_sv2_h_seo_title","value":"768728b36214cffaaca96bb36818bdb5"},{"id":9170,"key":"_sv2_seo_desc","value":"Bater\u00eda solar EcoFlow STREAM Ultra: 1,92 kWh, microinversor integrado. Env\u00edo a Francia y Espa\u00f1a, pago seguro."},{"id":9171,"key":"_sv2_h_seo_desc","value":"f89a3f608d6aa1b4b7b10bff70eb715b"}],"stock_status":"onbackorder","has_options":false,"post_password":"","global_unique_id":"4895251643764","permalink_template":"https:\/\/www.solandvolt.com\/produit\/%pagename%\/","generated_slug":"batterie-solaire-ecoflow-stream-ultra-192-kwh-micro-onduleur-integre","_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.solandvolt.com\/wp-json\/wc\/v3\/products\/494","targetHints":{"allow":["GET","POST","PUT","PATCH","DELETE"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.solandvolt.com\/wp-json\/wc\/v3\/products"}]}}